{"id":23728,"date":"2025-12-15T14:42:24","date_gmt":"2025-12-15T09:12:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/?post_type=property&#038;p=23728"},"modified":"2025-12-22T13:54:51","modified_gmt":"2025-12-22T08:24:51","slug":"signature-global-sarvam","status":"publish","type":"property","link":"https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/property\/signature-global-sarvam\/","title":{"rendered":"Signature Global Sarvam \u2013 DXP Estate Sector 37D Gurugram"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Signature Global Sarvam \u2013 Wellness-Led Living at DXP Estate, Sector 37D<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Signature Global Sarvam at DXP Estate is an upcoming premium residential development in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, thoughtfully envisioned as a wellness-centric community for modern families. Spread across approximately 13.5\u201314.5 acres within the larger DXP Estate ecosystem, Signature Global Sarvam offers spacious 3 and 4-BHK apartments set amid landscaped greens, curated amenities, and excellent connectivity to key NCR hubs.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Signature Global Sarvam Overview<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rooted in Vaastu principles and inspired by ancient wellness philosophies, Signature Global Sarvam is designed as a calm, nature-wrapped enclave where everyday life flows with balance and intention. Large decks, airy layouts, and green views create a serene backdrop, while the project\u2019s integration with DXP Estate ensures access to a broader ecosystem of retail, wellness, and recreational facilities along Dwarka Expressway.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Key project details include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Location: Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram (DXP Estate)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Land Area: ~13.5\u201314.5 acres within the estate<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Typology: 3 &amp; 4 BHK premium residences<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">RERA Reg. No.: RC\/REP\/HARERA\/GGM\/1008\/740\/2025\/111<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Status: New launch with targeted possession around 2031 (as per DXP Estate timelines in this corridor)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Wellness-Focused Highlights<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Signature Global Sarvam positions itself as a wellness-led address where architecture, planning, and amenities work together to support physical, mental, and emotional well-being.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Key highlights:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Homes aligned with Vaastu-inspired planning to enhance harmony, light, and energy flow.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Generous apartment layouts with well-defined living, dining, and deck spaces to elevate day-to-day comfort.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A wellness-centric lifestyle hub featuring spaces for fitness, mindfulness, and community engagement.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Design language that draws from timeless philosophies, translating mudras and ancient gestures into spatial experiences and zoning within the project.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Mudra-Inspired Design Concept of Signature Global Sarvam<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A unique aspect of Signature Global Sarvam is the \u201cMudras\u201d concept\u2014using the meaning of traditional hand gestures as inspiration for different zones and experiences within the development.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Illustrative mudras associated with the project:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Varuna Mudra<\/strong> \u2013 linked with cleansing and flow, influencing water bodies or calming landscape pockets.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Gyan Mudra<\/strong> \u2013 associated with clarity, reflected in reading lounges or contemplative corners.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Abhaya &amp; Anjali Mudras<\/strong> \u2013 symbolising protection and gratitude, inspiring entry experiences and community spaces.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Akash &amp; Prana Mudras<\/strong> \u2013 tied to expansion and life energy, guiding open decks, sky views, and movement areas.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">These conceptual cues are intended to create a sense of harmony as residents move through the development.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Homes, Floor Plans &amp; Space Planning<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Signature Global Sarvam offers multiple configurations of 3 and 4 BHK apartments, each carefully planned to maximise usable space, natural light, and cross-ventilation.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Indicative unit types at Signature Sarvam at DXP Estate:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3 BHK + 2T (Type 1 &amp; Type 2) \u2013 approx. 1815\u20131840 sq ft<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3 BHK + 3T \u2013 approx. 2050 sq ft<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3 BHK + 3T + Utility (Type 1 &amp; Type 2) \u2013 approx. 2260\u20132340 sq ft<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4 BHK + 4T + Utility \u2013 approx. 2495 sq ft<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Each unit typology typically includes:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Spacious living and dining zones<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Well-sized bedrooms with attached bathrooms (as per configuration)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Utility space in select 3BHK and all 4BHK units<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Balconies\/decks designed to extend the living area and open to views<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Floor and master plans are structured to optimise circulation, privacy between private and public zones of the home, and ease of furniture placement.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Amenities &amp; Wellness Ecosystem<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">As part of the DXP Estate and Signature Global Sarvam experience, residents are planned to enjoy a wide array of modern amenities designed around wellness, social connection, and everyday convenience.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Planned amenities include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Clubhouse with lounge, waiting areas, and community spaces<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Mini-theatre for intimate cinema experiences<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Co-working spaces for remote or hybrid professionals<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fitness area with gym-centric facilities<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Meditation and mindfulness zones<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Reading lounge and quiet corners for reflection<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Within the wider DXP ecosystem, Sarvam is complemented by partnerships with wellness and lifestyle brands such as:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Tatva Spa (spa &amp; healing experiences)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Michael Phelps Swimming Academy (swimming training)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Matrix by Tiger Shroff (fitness &amp; movement programs)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Tagda Raho by MS Dhoni (Indian strength-based training)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fittr (AI-enabled fitness guidance)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ajivasan Music Academy, Shriya Iyengar Yoga, and Climb Ups by Arjun Vajpai for music, yoga, and adventure-based experiences<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Location Advantage \u2013 Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Signature Global Sarvam benefits from a strategic location in Sector 37D, along the Dwarka Expressway growth corridor in Gurugram.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Connectivity highlights:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Sector 37D on Dwarka Expressway with easy access to NH-48 via Pataudi Road and Hero Honda Chowk.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Approximate drive times from the broader DXP Estate \/ Sector 37D cluster:<\/span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Around 10 minutes to the Delhi border (via expressway link)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Around 15\u201325 minutes to IGI Airport and Aerocity (once Dwarka Expressway is fully operational)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Connectivity to Cyber City, Sohna Road, and major employment hubs through NH-48, SPR, and related arterial roads.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The micro-market is surrounded by developed and developing residential sectors like 37C, 37B, and areas along Pataudi Road, supported by emerging social infrastructure and business parks.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">About Signature Global<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Signature Global is a leading North India-focused developer known for its strong presence in affordable, mid, and now premium housing segments across Gurugram and NCR. Since 2014, the group has delivered and launched multiple projects across high-potential corridors such as SPR, Dwarka Expressway, and Sohna Road\u2014emphasising quality constructi